# Persistent create, read, update, and delete in plain English.
application "Notes" is web
listen on 8080

model Note
field title is text required unique minimum 2 maximum 80
field body is text maximum 2000
that is all

controller Notes
when someone visits "/"
find all Note as notes
show view "notes" with notes
that is all

when someone submits "/notes"
create Note from form
redirect to "/"
that is all

when someone visits "/notes/{id}"
find Note by route id as note
show view "edit-note" with note
that is all

when someone submits "/notes/{id}"
update Note using route id from form
redirect to "/"
that is all

when someone submits "/notes/{id}/delete"
delete Note using route id
redirect to "/"
that is all
that is all

layout "application"
heading "Hyperian Notes"
content
that is all

component "note-link"
show note.title
link "Edit" to "/notes/{note.id}"
that is all

view "notes"
use layout "application"
title "My Notes"
form posts to "/notes"
input "Note title" as title required
input "Write your note" as body
button "Save note"
that is all
for each note in notes show
use component "note-link"
that is all
that is all

view "edit-note"
use layout "application"
title "Edit Note"
heading "Edit Note"
form posts to "/notes/{note.id}"
input "Note title" as title required
input "Write your note" as body
button "Save changes"
that is all
form posts to "/notes/{note.id}/delete"
button "Delete note"
that is all
link "Back to notes" to "/"
that is all
